  unitName: Hot Rocket Cayena
  unitId: 810004
  unitNumber: 8001
  description: A soldier from another world, Cayena fought only for righteous causes.
    She joined the Battle Maidens to wage war against the gods. However, their cataclysmic
    defeat revealed how futile it was relying only on righteous strength in taking
    on the infinite might of the gods. Consumed by this revelation, she left the
    Battle Maidens to pursue an even more destructive force.
  summonDesc: I have a feeling<br>We'll get along really well!<br>I'll stand up for
    you anytime!
  fusionDesc: Just so you know,<br>half of that went into Feurig.<br>We're getting
    stronger together.
  evoDesc: I've acquired more strength.<br>I have the power to destroy all things
    evil!
